'''Gude-Doge Machine''' (ぐでわんこマシン) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Gude-Doge Machine
|image = E 409.png
|appearance = [[Gudetama Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 3,000円 - 11,850円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has a design mirroring [[Cat Machine (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Machine]]. It's a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless enemy]] that has a 100% chance to [[Freeze|freeze]] Cat Units. It also has 390 range, the same as the [[Crazed Tank Cat (Enemy)|Crazed Tank]]! Adding onto that, Gude-Doge Machine has respectable health and damage, its main weakness is the somewhat long attack rate and animation.

==Strategy==
[[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Units with Long Distance]] like [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Mina]] can help slowly chip him down. Otherwise, take advantage of his slow attack rate to deal as much damage as possible with rushers, like [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier]] or [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman.]]

